{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":227,"count":41,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L01-2-09\",\"请问\",\"請問\",\"请问\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"請問你是臺灣人嗎？","pinyin":"Qǐngwèn nǐ shì Táiwān rén ma?","english":"Excuse me, are you Taiwanese?","sourceCardId":"B1L01-2-09","sourceFront":"請問","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"請問妳是哪國人？","pinyin":"Qǐngwèn nǐ shì nǎ guó rén?","english":"May I ask where you are from?","sourceCardId":"B1L01-2-01","sourceFront":"什麼","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"妳好！我是李中明，請問妳叫什麼名字？","pinyin":"Nǐ hǎo! Wǒ shì Lǐ Zhōngmíng, qǐngwèn nǐ jiào shénme míngzi?","english":"Hi, my name is Li Zhongming. May I ask what your name is?","sourceCardId":"B1L01-2-01","sourceFront":"什麼","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"請問兩位要紅茶還是綠茶？","pinyin":"Qǐngwèn liǎng wèi yào hóngchá háishì lǜchá?","english":"Would you like to have black tea or green tea?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"請給我們一杯紅茶、一杯綠茶。請問一共多少錢？","pinyin":"Qǐng gěi wǒmen yì bēi hóngchá, yì bēi lǜchá. Qǐngwèn yígòng duōshǎo qián?","english":"We would to have a cup of black tea and a cup of green tea. How much does that cost altogether?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"請問我需要吃藥嗎？","pinyin":"Qǐngwèn wǒ xūyào chī yào ma?","english":"Do I have to take any medicine?","sourceCardId":"B1L10-2-01","sourceFront":"咳嗽/咳","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L03-2-03\",\"種\",\"種\",\"种\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你喜歡喝哪種茶？","pinyin":"Nǐ xǐhuān hē nǎ zhǒng chá?","english":"What kind of tea do you like?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-03","sourceFront":"種","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A：你要哪種筆？ B：我要鉛筆。","pinyin":"A: Nǐ yào nǎ zhǒng bǐ? B: Wǒ yào qiānbǐ.","english":"A: What kind of pen do you want? B: I want a pencil.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-04","sourceFront":"鉛筆","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"A：這種蛋糕很貴嗎？ B：是啊，這種蛋糕不便宜。","pinyin":"A: Zhè zhǒng dàngāo hěn guì ma? B: Shì ā, zhè zhǒng dàngāo bù piányí.","english":"A: Is this kind of cake expensive? B: Yes, this kind of cake is not cheap.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-12","sourceFront":"便宜","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這種小鉛筆怎麼樣？","pinyin":"Zhè zhǒng xiǎo qiānbǐ zěnmeyàng?","english":"What do you think about this type of small pencil?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-01","sourceFront":"這","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這種飲料很好喝。","pinyin":"Zhè zhǒng yǐnliào hěn hǎohē.","english":"This kind of beverage tastes good.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-19","sourceFront":"好喝","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他們賣很多種飲料。","pinyin":"Tāmen mài hěn duō zhǒng yǐnliào.","english":"They have various kinds of drink.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-01","sourceFront":"咖啡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有啊！他們有很多種冰淇淋。","pinyin":"Yǒu a! Tāmen yǒu hěn duō zhǒng bīngqílín.","english":"Oh, yeah. They have lots of kinds of ice cream.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-01","sourceFront":"錢包","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們下個星期要學第十五課，我剛才先看了一點兒，書上有很多種動物，我覺得很有意思。","pinyin":"Wǒmen xià ge xīngqí yào xué dì shíwǔ kè, wǒ gāngcái xiān kàn le yìdiǎnr, shū shàng yǒu hěn duō zhǒng dòngwù, wǒ juéde hěn yǒuyìsi.","english":"We are going to learn lesson fifteen next week. I previewed a bit earlier just now. There are many kinds of animals in the book; I think it is very interesting.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"華人用不一樣的動物代表每一年，一共有十二種動物。","pinyin":"Huárén yòng bù yíyàng de dòngwù dàibiǎo měi yì nián, yígòng yǒu shí'èr zhǒng dòngwù.","english":"Chinese use different animals to represent each year, and there are a total of twelve kinds of animals.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 禾(grain) holds a 重(heavy) load → every single 種(kind)."},{"key":"[\"B1L11-1-12\",\"聊\",\"聊\",\"聊\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你們在聊什麼？聊得好開心。","pinyin":"Nǐmen zài liáo shénme? Liáo de hǎo kāixīn.","english":"What are you chatting about? You're chatting so happily.","sourceCardId":"B1L11-1-12","sourceFront":"聊","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他說話很有趣，所以每個人都喜歡跟他聊天。","pinyin":"Tā shuōhuà hěn yǒuqù, suǒyǐ měi ge rén dōu xǐhuan gēn tā liáotiān.","english":"He speaks interestingly, so everyone likes to chat with him.","sourceCardId":"B1L11-1-10","sourceFront":"聊天兒","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我跟朋友聊天，聊得很愉快。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-13","sourceFront":"愉快","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個電視節目很無聊，我們去看電影吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-22","sourceFront":"無聊","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個外國學生常跟台灣朋友聊天，用中文表達自己的意見。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-11","sourceFront":"表達","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個外國學生常跟台灣朋友聊天，用中文表達自己的意見。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-12","sourceFront":"意見","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了練習英文的聽力和會話，我每天都跟美國朋友聊天。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-11","sourceFront":"會話","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我喜歡週末跟家人聚在一起吃飯、聊天。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-15","sourceFront":"聚","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"昨天小康碰到一位好久不見的老朋友，他們聊天聊到很晚才回家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-22","sourceFront":"碰到","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小陳很孝順，每個週末都去安養院陪父親聊天、散步，一點兒都不覺得辛苦","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-23","sourceFront":"孝順","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"夏天的夜晚，人們喜歡在屋子外面吹著風、喝著茶，聊聊有趣的事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-12","sourceFront":"夜晚","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張先生的個性很活潑、說話很幽默，跟他聊天總是很愉快。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-22","sourceFront":"幽默","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母要經常陪孩子聊天、玩遊戲，給零用錢不能完全滿足孩子的需要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-25","sourceFront":"需要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"跟張先生聊天時，總是我問一句，他答一句，真沒意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-12","sourceFront":"句","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"叔叔時常跟我聊他到世界各地旅行的故事，真是有意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-37","sourceFront":"時常","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他不管我忙不忙，老是黏著我聊天，讓我覺得有點煩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-40","sourceFront":"黏","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我叔叔總是說工作很累想休息，可是休了假之後又覺得無聊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-10","sourceFront":"休假","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當你心裡覺得難受的時候，可以跟好朋友聊聊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-10","sourceFront":"難受","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現代人生活忙碌，就算是好友也偶然才碰面聊聊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-24","sourceFront":"偶然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"an 耳(ear) at the 卯(mortise) catches gossip and starts to 聊(chat)."},{"key":"[\"B1L12-1-10\",\"以后\",\"以後\",\"以后\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"考試開始以後，我們不可以跟同學說話。","pinyin":"Kǎoshì kāishǐ yǐhòu, wǒmen bù kěyǐ gēn tóngxué shuōhuà.","english":"After the exam starts, we cannot talk with classmates.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-1-10","sourceFront":"以後","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"下班以後，她常跟朋友一起去跑步。","pinyin":"Xiàbān yǐhòu, tā cháng gēn péngyǒu yìqǐ qù pǎobù.","english":"After getting off work, she often goes running with friends.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-1-17","sourceFront":"下班","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"下班以後，我常跟同事一起去吃晚飯。","pinyin":"Xiàbān yǐhòu, wǒ cháng gēn tóngshì yìqǐ qù chī wǎnfàn.","english":"After getting off work, I often go to eat dinner with colleagues.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-2-04","sourceFront":"同事","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我希望以後可以去他家玩。","pinyin":"Wǒ xīwàng yǐhòu kěyǐ qù tā jiā wán.","english":"I hope that in the future I can go to his house to have fun.","sourceCardId":"B1L11-2-02","sourceFront":"以後","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"來台灣以後，每個週末我都有很多活動，覺得很開心。","pinyin":"Lái Táiwān yǐhòu, měi ge zhōumò wǒ dōu yǒu hěn duō huódòng, juéde hěn kāixīn.","english":"After coming to Taiwan, I have many activities every weekend and feel very happy.","sourceCardId":"B1L14-1-02","sourceFront":"活動","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"來台灣以後，我認識了很多國家的新朋友。","pinyin":"Lái Táiwān yǐhòu, wǒ rènshi le hěn duō guójiā de xīn péngyǒu.","english":"After coming to Taiwan, I have met many new friends from many countries.","sourceCardId":"B1L14-3-01","sourceFront":"國家","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他的計畫是畢業以後到美國去工作。","pinyin":"Tā de jìhuà shì bìyè yǐhòu dào Měiguó qù gōngzuò.","english":"His plan is to go to the United States to work after graduation.","sourceCardId":"B1L16-1-03","sourceFront":"計畫","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"哥哥洗澡以後都先喝一瓶牛奶再睡覺。","pinyin":"Gēge xǐzǎo yǐhòu dōu xiān hē yì píng niúnǎi zài shuìjiào.","english":"After my older brother takes a shower, he always first drinks a bottle of milk and then goes to sleep.","sourceCardId":"B1L16-2-07","sourceFront":"洗澡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"念了一個小時的書以後，你最好休息十分鐘。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-28","sourceFront":"念書","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這種藥很有用，吃了以後頭就不疼了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-32","sourceFront":"有用","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下課以後，我要跟同學討論去日月潭旅行的事情。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-32","sourceFront":"討論","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"付了房租以後，你這個月的獎學金還剩多少？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-36","sourceFront":"剩","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"山本良介來台灣以後，搬了兩次家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-16","sourceFront":"搬家","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次的旅遊真有意思，我以後還想多去幾個地方玩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-07","sourceFront":"旅遊","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"請你想像一下，二十年以後，你的生活會怎麼樣？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-15","sourceFront":"想像","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他的英文、日文都很好，畢業以後想當翻譯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-27","sourceFront":"翻","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他很煩惱，不知道畢業以後要找什麼工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-20","sourceFront":"煩惱","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"隔壁的王媽媽化妝以後，變年輕了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-22","sourceFront":"變","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"運動以後最好喝開水，不要喝太甜的飲料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-38","sourceFront":"開水","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有了捷運以後，台北市的交通情況改善了很多。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-09","sourceFront":"改善","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有了捷運以後，台北市的交通情況改善了很多。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-10","sourceFront":"情況","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"孩子出國留學以後，父母發現孩子成長了不少。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-23","sourceFront":"成長","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"王教授退休以後，每個週末都去育幼院陪孩子讀書。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-31","sourceFront":"退休","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"爸爸下班以後，總是先洗個澡、喝個飲料，再吃晚飯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-09","sourceFront":"個","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我參加了愛心服務社以後，想法比以前更成熟了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-14","sourceFront":"成熟","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"以凡學了中文以後，他覺得東方文化和西方文化很不一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-14","sourceFront":"東方","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"以凡學了中文以後，他覺得東方文化和西方文化很不一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-15","sourceFront":"西方","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"店員把這台咖啡機的特色說明得非常清楚，聽了他的說明以後，大家都很感興趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-13","sourceFront":"說明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個城市的空氣變乾淨了，主要是因為有捷運以後，開車的人比以前少了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-25","sourceFront":"主要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那場強烈地震發生以後，許多國家的專業人員都來救災，讓人非常感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-22","sourceFront":"救災","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小畢本來認為自己的書法寫得很好，但是上次比賽輸了以後，他就失去自信了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-14","sourceFront":"自信","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"李小姐結婚以後的生活重心就是家庭，尤其是照顧剛出生的小孩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-01","sourceFront":"尤其","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家工廠自從改善了設備以後，生產速度就一天比一天快了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-01","sourceFront":"自從","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下課以後，老師幫我一對一補習數學，希望我的期末考會及格","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-11","sourceFront":"對","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不少人批評那家健身中心教練的教學品質很差，以後絕對不會再去了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-09","sourceFront":"批評","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有關這場火災的詳細情況，等調查結果出來以後，市長會向民眾報告。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-31","sourceFront":"有關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"姊姊有了自己的孩子以後，才體會到當父母是很辛苦的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-24","sourceFront":"體會","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這種鬧鐘有點特別，響了以後得按三下才能關掉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-12","sourceFront":"按","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從有了抽號機以後，人們就不需要站著排隊了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-13","sourceFront":"抽號機","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"吃了健康食品以後，還是得經常運動才能擁有好身材。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-19","sourceFront":"食品","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"註了冊以後，新生要把相關證件各影印一份，交給學校。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-38","sourceFront":"各","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"食品罐頭吃完以後把罐子洗乾淨，就可以回收了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-09","sourceFront":"罐頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他從音樂學院畢業以後就加入歌劇團，到世界各地表演。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-03","sourceFront":"歌劇","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從他改變飲食習慣以後，就變得既健康又有活力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-30","sourceFront":"活力","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從住校以後，我得學習自己收拾、整理房間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-58","sourceFront":"收拾","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"知道自己誤會別人以後，最好早一點兒跟對方道歉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-14","sourceFront":"誤會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"考完試以後，我們去海洋公園開開心心地玩一場吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-07","sourceFront":"場","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些事明明不對，卻因沒人敢說，久了以後就被社會接受了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-13","sourceFront":"明明","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他想等中文程度達到高級以後，就來臺灣念大學。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-01","sourceFront":"高級","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從開始掉頭髮以後，醫師就建議他每天吃半顆維他命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-32","sourceFront":"顆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L01-1-21\",\"動物園\",\"動物園\",\"动物园\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個動物園裡有很多動物，我最喜歡的是老虎跟猴子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-21","sourceFront":"動物園","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"要不是下大雨，我們就去動物園玩了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-22","sourceFront":"要不是","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L03-2-04\",\"灯\",\"燈\",\"灯\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這是燈籠。","pinyin":"Zhè shì dēnglóng.","english":"This is a lantern.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"燈籠上的小老虎好可愛。","pinyin":"Dēnglóng shàng de xiǎo lǎohǔ hǎo kě'ài.","english":"The little tiger on the lantern is so lovely.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這個星期六是元宵節，妳跟友美會去看燈會嗎？","pinyin":"Zhè ge xīngqī liù shì Yuánxiāojié, nǐ gēn Yǒuměi huì qù kàn dēnghuì ma?","english":"This Saturday is the Lantern Festival. Will you and Youmei go to see the Lantern Carnival?","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"友美說她想去，我還沒決定去不去。燈會好玩嗎？","pinyin":"Yǒuměi shuō tā xiǎng qù, wǒ háiméi juédìng qù bú qù. Dēnghuì hǎowán ma?","english":"Youmei wants to see it. But I haven’t decided to go. Is the Lantern Carnival fun?","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我去年去看了，很多大人帶著小孩去看燈會，非常熱鬧，我照了很多相片。","pinyin":"Wǒ qùnián qù kàn le, hěn duō dàrén dài zhe xiǎohái qù kàn dēnghuì, fēicháng rènào, wǒ zhào le hěn duō xiàngpiàn.","english":"Last year I went to see the Carnival. Many adults brought their children to see the Lantern Carnival, and it was very lively. I took a lot of photos.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我週末還要工作，打算一下班就去看燈會。我們可以約友美一起去。","pinyin":"Wǒ zhōumò hái yào gōngzuò, dǎsuàn yí xiàbān jiù qù kàn dēnghuì. Wǒmen kěyǐ yuē Yǒuměi yìqǐ qù.","english":"I have to work on weekends, and plan to go to the Lantern Carnival as soon as I get off from work. We can ask Youmei out for the Lantern Carnival together.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L04-1-36\",\"特别是\",\"特別是\",\"特别是\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L05-1-14\",\"露營\",\"露營\",\"露营\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"週末的時候，我喜歡跟朋友去野餐或是露營。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-14","sourceFront":"露營","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"以前沒什麼人喜歡露營，可是最近露營變成了一種流行的活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-30","sourceFront":"變成","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"颱風快來了，破壞了我本來要去露營的計畫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-20","sourceFront":"破壞","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我最喜歡的休閒活動是爬山和露營","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-01","sourceFront":"休閒","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我和朋友昨天去河邊露營， 我們試著在河裡抓魚，沒想到真的抓到了五條魚","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-16","sourceFront":"抓","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次的露營活動因為颱風辦不成了，可以說計畫永遠沒辦法趕上變化","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-09","sourceFront":"趕上","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"明天的露營活動還欠什麼東西？我可以帶過來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-51","sourceFront":"欠","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我跟朋友的愛好一樣，都喜歡露營。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-04","sourceFront":"愛好","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他們在露營活動中現學現唱了八首歌，真是了不起。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-30","sourceFront":"現","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"露營最開心的就是當營火(campfire)燃燒時，大家在營火周圍又唱又跳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-41","sourceFront":"燃燒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"露營時我沒帶枕頭，只好把背包當作枕頭，睡起來挺不舒服的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-08","sourceFront":"枕頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了安全起見，颱風天到山區露營的行為是被嚴格禁止的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-19","sourceFront":"起見","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L05-1-20\",\"睡著\",\"睡著\",\"睡着\",\"Vp\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"爸爸看電視，看著看著就睡著了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-20","sourceFront":"睡著","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L08-1-40\",\"想出來\",\"想出（來）\",\"想出（来）\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我已經坐了四、五個小時了，想出去走走！","pinyin":"Wǒ yǐjīng zuò le sì, wǔ gè xiǎoshí le, xiǎng chūqù zǒuzou!","english":"I have already been sitting for four or five hours, I want to go out and walk around!","sourceCardId":"B1L14-1-17","sourceFront":"坐","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"要是你想出國留學，一定得加強外語能力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-16","sourceFront":"加強","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我想出國當背包客，除了能打開視野，並能訓練自己更獨立。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-31","sourceFront":"並","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L10-1-38\",\"開水\",\"開水\",\"开水\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"運動以後最好喝開水，不要喝太甜的飲料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-38","sourceFront":"開水","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L12-1-17\",\"困難\",\"困難\",\"困难\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"沒有專業能力的人，想找到好職業是很困難的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-17","sourceFront":"困難","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"陳可欣是一個勇敢、樂觀的人，什麼麻煩、困難的問題都不怕。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-19","sourceFront":"樂觀","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"在追求夢想的路上，會遇到很困難的事情，只有不斷努力，才能完成夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-01","sourceFront":"追求","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個地區因為到處淹水，走路、開車都很困難，連網路也不通了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-14","sourceFront":"通","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"歐先生有閱讀的障礙，就算一篇極短的文章，讀起來也覺得很困難。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-25","sourceFront":"障礙","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對連電腦都不知道怎麼打開的人來說，上網購物是一件非常困難的事情。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-25","sourceFront":"困難","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當我遇到挫折時，他總是協助我克服困難，我們之間也建立了珍貴的友誼。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-15","sourceFront":"友誼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你聽了尤老闆勇敢克服困難、堅持到底的真實故事，有什麼感想？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-02","sourceFront":"感想","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當鄰居生活遇到困難時，老馬總是主動提供協助，真令人感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-04","sourceFront":"令","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了愛惜食物資源，同時也幫助生活困難的家庭，張老闆決定在國內開幾家食物銀行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-15","sourceFront":"開","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他們從小時候就很要好，有困難時一起解決，有好東西也會分給對方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-40","sourceFront":"要好","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"世界上再困難的問題，不管早或晚都會有聰明的人解開的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-51","sourceFront":"解","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對自己的事業很熱情的人，就不怕挑戰任何困難。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-34","sourceFront":"熱情","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"碰到困難無法繼續前進時，暫時後退等待機會也是一種作法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-21","sourceFront":"後退","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他一直熱愛翻譯工作，不論多困難都會想辦法克服。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-18","sourceFront":"熱愛","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"看見有困難的人們，有能力的話就得想辦法幫助他們，不應該不理他們。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-53","sourceFront":"理","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當你面臨困難或挑戰時，也正是表現個人智慧與能力的最佳時刻。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-17","sourceFront":"面臨","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每次當我們在學習華語上遇到困難，老師總是耐心地教導大家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-36","sourceFront":"耐心","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果有任何困難請別客氣，我很樂意幫你的忙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-04","sourceFront":"樂意","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有朋友與家人的鼓勵，使他在面對任何困難時都十分自信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-47","sourceFront":"自信","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"中國古代的人們相信，當好人碰到危險或困難時，會有神仙到人間來幫助他們。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-08","sourceFront":"神仙","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"處理老房屋的問題，有時比重新建築一棟房子還要困難。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-37","sourceFront":"建築","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"只有勇敢面對挑戰、克服困難的人，才能深深體會到成就感帶來的快樂。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-18","sourceFront":"成就感","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"樂觀的人會積極挑戰困難，就算無法成功也不會感到失望。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-24","sourceFront":"感到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 困(be stuck) and 難(hard): 困難 means difficulty."},{"key":"[\"B3L01-1-03\",\"明星\",\"明星\",\"明星\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這部戲不但明星演得好，劇本也寫得不錯，所以票賣得非常好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-10","sourceFront":"劇本","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"那個明星演戲前都會先研究戲裡的人物、故事，最後才決定表演的方式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-04","sourceFront":"演戲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"那個明星很會演戲，演了幾年戲就開始當導演，沒想到第一部戲就成功了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-15","sourceFront":"導演","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"李小龍（Bruce Lee）是七○年 （qīlíng niándài，1970∼1979） 非常有名的功夫明星。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-03","sourceFront":"年代","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"美美剛進模特兒公司時，有一位導演找她演戲，沒想到就讓她變成了有名的明星。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-12","sourceFront":"進","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位大明星身上穿的、手上戴的 ，都是有名的牌子","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-11","sourceFront":"身上","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我昨天晚上做了一個夢，夢到跟我最喜歡的明星一同演戲，開心得不得了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-07","sourceFront":"一同","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那場演唱會請到了大家最喜愛的明星，所以門票很快就被搶光了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-41","sourceFront":"搶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個明星對穿著很講究，總是花很多時間，研究什麼上衣配什麼長褲才好看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-01","sourceFront":"穿著","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小張不僅長得帥，穿著也很有品味，所以很多人都以為他是明星。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-20","sourceFront":"帥","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"電影明星一向很重視自己的穿著，合適的穿著才能讓他們更有品味、更有自信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-05","sourceFront":"一向","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路直播的內容各種各樣，甚至有人因為直播平日生活而變成明星。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-13","sourceFront":"直播","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有位功夫明星的動作很快，一次能踢十幾腿，真的讓人驚訝。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-27","sourceFront":"動作","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了拍跟武術有關的電影，那位美國明星到中國學習了半年的中國功夫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-12","sourceFront":"武術","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他相當迷那位明星，因此不管穿的用的都模仿他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-18","sourceFront":"模仿","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個背包在設計上沒什麼特色，只是印了某位明星隨手畫的圖，沒想到就要賣上萬元，實在有點兒誇張。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-30","sourceFront":"印","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個角色一直找不到合適的演員，幸好那位明星點頭答應演出，否則影片就拍不成了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-31","sourceFront":"點頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"手機廠商時常邀請明星替他們的產品宣傳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-14","sourceFront":"廠商","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到機場時看見一群戲迷正追著電影明星照相，真有意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-01","sourceFront":"追","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人人都崇拜明星，但有多少人了解成功背後所付出的一切？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-29","sourceFront":"崇拜","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 明(bright) and 星(star): 明星 means star movie or television."},{"key":"[\"B3L01-2-10\",\"保證\",\"保證\",\"保证\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"沒有人能保證上了有名的大學，未來就一定快樂、幸福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-10","sourceFront":"保證","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"你得把保證書帶來，我們才能幫你免費修理電腦。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-20","sourceFront":"修理","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"你說這部筆電可以用三年，你能給我什麼保證？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-19","sourceFront":"保證","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"只要你堅持每天學習一個小時的中文，我保證你的程度一定會越來越好的","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-07","sourceFront":"堅持","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個老闆做生意不老實，一再跟客人保證商品沒問題，其實是騙人的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-08","sourceFront":"老實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"總統到地震災區慰問災民，並保證會協助他們恢復正常的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-09","sourceFront":"慰問","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大多數投資專家都不敢保證在房屋市場一定能賺錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-03","sourceFront":"專家","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自動化工廠不僅使生產速度更快，同時也能保證產品品質。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-46","sourceFront":"自動化","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 保(safeguard) and 證(prove): 保證 means guarantee."},{"key":"[\"B3L02-1-12\",\"泡面\",\"泡麵\",\"泡面\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"小歐為了省錢，整個月都吃泡麵，最後吃壞了身體，吃藥、住院花了更多錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-12","sourceFront":"泡麵","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"你回家經過賣韓國貨的超市時，可以順便幫我買兩包泡麵嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-01","sourceFront":"貨","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"李先生從不吃泡麵、薯條、熱狗那樣的食物，因為他覺得不健康。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-34","sourceFront":"從不","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一聽說颱風快來了，許多民眾就去超市搶購蔬菜、水果、泡麵等食物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-29","sourceFront":"民眾","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"氣象預報人員確定明天颱風會來，我們最好去吃超市買一些泡麵、雞蛋","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-29","sourceFront":"確定","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L09-1-30\",\"合理\",\"合理\",\"合理\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個牌子的運動服在夜市賣五百元，可是在百貨公司賣兩千元，你覺得合理嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-30","sourceFront":"合理","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"購物時，最好要貨比三家，才能買到品質較佳、價格較合理的商品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-10","sourceFront":"較","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這座島的風景很美，旅館價格也很合理，難怪不少遊客年年都來這裡旅行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-26","sourceFront":"年年","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有一些研究科學的人，對不科學、無法合理解釋的現象都不太相信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-12","sourceFront":"科學","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家禮品店的商品樣式不錯，並且價格合理，所以生意很好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-30","sourceFront":"並且","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在自由國家，只要人民覺得不合理，都能跟相關部門抗議。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-15","sourceFront":"抗議","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"When facts 合(combine) smoothly with logical 理(science) principles: 合理 means reasonable."},{"key":"[\"B3L15-1-32\",\"幸好\",\"幸好\",\"幸好\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"上次我出國旅行時，護照被偷了，幸好導遊通知了當地的外交人員，很快就辦好了新護照。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-33","sourceFront":"導遊","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這個角色一直找不到合適的演員，幸好那位明星點頭答應演出，否則影片就拍不成了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-31","sourceFront":"點頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Receiving a stroke of 幸(favor) that turns out 好(good): 幸好 means fortunately."},{"key":"[\"B4L01-1-50\",\"小氣\",\"小氣\",\"小气\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他對自己很小氣，可是對朋友卻很大方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-50","sourceFront":"小氣","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L02-1-17\",\"单子\",\"單子\",\"单子\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我去醫院看完病後，醫生給了我一張單子去櫃檯付錢和領藥。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-17","sourceFront":"單子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L03-1-52\",\"退回\",\"退回\",\"退回\",\"Vpt\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他的獎學金申請書因少了一份資料，已被學校退回。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-52","sourceFront":"退回","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L03-2-12\",\"大量\",\"大量\",\"大量\",\"Det\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這次颱風可能帶來大量雨水，地形較低的地區應該多注意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-12","sourceFront":"大量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"過年時，著名點心店都會收到大量的訂單，甚至有顧客在半年前就下訂單了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-16","sourceFront":"訂單","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"鑽石因為無法大量出產，所以才變得珍貴。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-37","sourceFront":"鑽石","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L04-2-14\",\"沖\",\"沖\",\"冲\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他沖咖啡的技術很好，香味總是比別人沖的濃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-14","sourceFront":"沖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L05-1-50\",\"肺\",\"肺\",\"肺\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"空氣越髒，人們的肺也就越不健康。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-50","sourceFront":"肺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那家工廠排出的黑煙不只氣味難聞，更可怕的是可能對肺部造成傷害。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-14","sourceFront":"煙","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L05-2-08\",\"電扇\",\"電扇\",\"电扇\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"開冷氣時如果能好好利用電扇，房間很快就涼了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-08","sourceFront":"電扇","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L05-2-25\",\"金屬\",\"金屬\",\"金属\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那個眼鏡的金屬材料相當特別，因此價格比一般眼鏡貴三成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-25","sourceFront":"金屬","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L06-2-09\",\"寧願\",\"寧願\",\"宁愿\",\"Vaux\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"為了更有效地利用地球資源，我寧願減少不必要的生活享受。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-09","sourceFront":"寧願","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-1-05\",\"插花\",\"插花\",\"插花\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"媽媽買了鮮花來插花，她覺得插花是一門藝術，讓人欣賞到花的美。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-05","sourceFront":"插花","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L12-1-24\",\"闖\",\"闖\",\"闯\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"開車時不闖紅燈，是為了自己和別人的生命安全。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-24","sourceFront":"闖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-1-30\",\"转身\",\"轉身\",\"转身\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"今天搭捷運參加演唱會的民眾很多，車上擠得都不能轉身。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-30","sourceFront":"轉身","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-1-41\",\"醫學\",\"醫學\",\"医学\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"隨著科技進步，醫學也不斷前進，當醫師的人得多充實自己。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-41","sourceFront":"醫學","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"對我來說，閱讀醫學系列的小說是一個很好的休閒活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-04","sourceFront":"系列","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L14-1-04\",\"初級\",\"初級\",\"初级\",\"N/V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他很聰明，成績又非常好，因此完成初級班的課程後，學校讓他跳過中級，到高級班學習，一連跳了兩級。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-04","sourceFront":"初級","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-1-18\",\"派\",\"派\",\"派\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"她的外語能力不錯，因此公司經常派她到國外出差。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-18","sourceFront":"派","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那支軍隊受的是特殊訓練，只在發生重大戰爭時才派出。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-49","sourceFront":"支","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"乏\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A sharp stroke 丿(slash) cuts right through 之(it), leaving nothing behind: 乏(poor)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"住\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 亻(person) rests with the 主(master) → choosing to 住(reside) here."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"偏\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 亻(person) leans on a 扁(board), so both tilt into 偏(slanting)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"合適\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 合(combine) and 適(match): 合適 means suitable."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"問\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"At the 門(door) you open your 口(mouth) to politely 問(ask) directions."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"聽眾\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"To 聽(hear) a 眾(multitude): 聽眾 means listener."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"超商\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 超(surpass) and 商(commerce): 超商 means convenience store."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"頭髮\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"頭(head) + 髮(hair) → the hair on your head."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"顏\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"an 彥(elegant) 頁(head) opens up to reveal a fine 顏(face) to all."}]}
